<div class="box box-default">
    <div class="box-header with-border"><h3 class="box-title">Bedrock Players</h3></div>
    <div class="box-body">
        <p>Player rosters and moderation for official Bedrock Dedicated Server, Endstone, Nukkit/PowerNukkit and PocketMine-MP. Use Route eggs above to restrict the tab to your Bedrock servers.</p>
        <p>The addon runs the fixed <code>list</code> command and reads its fresh response over an authenticated Wings websocket. Bedrock UDP status provides counts when names cannot be read. Enable UDP on the assigned game port, usually 19132. English native list output is supported; custom/localized command output can differ.</p>
        <p>Console permission is required. OP/de-OP are owner/admin only. Endstone, Nukkit and PocketMine expose their native ban controls; official BDS exposes kick and allowlist controls. Removing an allowlist entry does not enable allowlisting or constitute a ban.</p>
        <p>Inventory, hearts, hunger and XP require an exporter writing <code>/bedrock-player-snapshots.json</code> in the game server root, plus file listing and content permissions. Java player saves and Java skins are not used for Bedrock gamertags. The page is read-only except for confirmed native moderation commands.</p>
    </div>
</div>
